{"_v":3,"id":"grease-regional-2023","cat":"regional","cs":74.99,"rc":9,"bd":{"positive":6,"mixed":3,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"Chris Jones","o":"Chicago Tribune","s":65,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"v":"mixed","u":"https://www.chicagotribune.com/entertainment/theater/reviews/ct-ent-grease-drury-lane-theatre-review-20230425-hyyw7wexzzaeppsdi4dddnl4oi-story.html","d":"2023-04-25","q":"This is the show people know and “Grease” still is the word.","tc":1},{"cn":"Catey Sullivan","o":"Chicago Sun-Times","s":76,"b":"Positive","t":2,"v":"positive","u":"https://chicago.suntimes.com/2023/4/25/23696260/grease-review-drury-lane-theatre-chicago","d":"2023-04-25","q":"There’s more nostalgia and style than story or substance in this production of “Grease.”"},{"cn":"Karen Topham","o":"Chicago On Stage","s":90,"b":"Rave","t":3,"v":"rave","u":"https://www.chicagoonstage.com/grease-is-still-as-always-the-word-and-it-is-dazzling/","d":"2023-04-21","q":"This is one Grease that shouldn't be missed."},{"cn":"Colin Douglas","o":"Chicago Theatre Review","s":87,"b":"Rave","t":3,"v":"rave","u":"https://www.chicagotheatrereview.com/2023/04/hopelessly-devoted-to-you/","d":"2023-04-22","q":"This popular musical, which probably isn’t new to most theatergoers, is a high-octane hit."},{"cn":"Barbara Vitello","o":"Daily Herald","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":3,"v":"positive","u":"https://www.dailyherald.com/entlife/20230421/drury-lane-rocks-and-bops-down-memory-lane-with-its-revival-of-grease","d":"2023-04-21","q":"Propelled by conductor Christopher Sargent's rockin' sextet, Drury Lane's exuberant cast impresses."},{"cn":"Rick McCain","o":"Let's Play Theatrical Reviews","s":62,"b":"Mixed","t":3,"v":"mixed","u":"https://www.letsplaytheatricalreview.com/blog/grease","d":"2023-04-20","q":"But, unfortunately, with all those wonderful memories, this two-act, two hours, and ten-minute production of Grease weren't as memorable."},{"cn":"Rikki Lee Travolta","o":"Life and Times","s":89,"b":"Rave","t":4,"v":"rave","u":"https://lifeandtimes.biz/2023/04/29/get-ready-to-rumble-drury-lane-grease-sparkles-and-thrills/","d":"2023-04-29","q":"You’d have to be dead not to have a good time."},{"cn":"Susan Lillis","o":"Splash Magazines","s":75,"b":"Positive","t":4,"v":"positive","u":"https://splashmags.com/index.php/2023/04/21/grease-acknowledges-its-origins-in-chicago-at-the-drury-lane-theatre-from-april-21-through-june-4-2023/","d":"2023-04-21","q":"I, as well as a very enthusiastic and supportive audience, reveled in the nostalgia promoted in this production with its top-notch dance and song numbers."},{"cn":"Alan Bresloff","o":"Around the Town Chicago","s":73,"b":"Positive","t":4,"v":"positive","u":"http://www.aroundthetownchicago.com/theatre-reviews/grease-2/","q":"If you love \"Grease\", the movie, and have never seen the stage production, you will truly enjoy this presentation."}],"hi":"/images/shows/grease-regional-2023/hero.webp?v=25cb1285"}